## What is unrecoverable from this session

State plainly what a fresh reader cannot reconstruct — an auditor's full
reasoning, an unpersisted intermediate judgement, a discarded worker attempt.
If nothing, say "nothing known."

## Immediate next action

One sentence. If it is a resume, say resume-from-checkpoint explicitly; if it
is a re-dispatch, say so explicitly. Never both (`skills/core/continuation.md`).

## Open questions for a human

Only if one is genuinely open. Otherwise: "none."

