## Continuation record

    <project>/CONTINUATION.json     the machine-readable declaration
    python3 <pack_root>/tools/continuation.py <project>/CONTINUATION.json

This file names the current position in prose. That file names what is being
waited for and how anyone can observe it finishing, and the state is derived
from it rather than written into it — so it is right after a job exits even
though nobody edited anything. Read both; where they disagree, this file and the
governance record win, and the derivation is the defect.
